WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.330
Sid hung his head.

2
00:00:08.338 --> 00:00:13.510
"I'm not good at jumping," he said.

3
00:00:13.511 --> 00:00:16.549
"Don't be silly," Sara said.

4
00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:18.975
"You just need practice."

5
00:00:18.976 --> 00:00:21.594
"That's right," Tor said.

6
00:00:21.595 --> 00:00:26.465
Rex nodded. "Try again, Sid!"

7
00:00:26.466 --> 00:00:34.578
Sid sighed. "Okay."

8
00:00:34.579 --> 00:00:42.722
Rex swung the vine again.

9
00:00:42.723 --> 00:00:45.849
This time Sid held his tail.

10
00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:50.248
Sid jumped.

11
00:00:50.249 --> 00:00:53.844
"I did it!" Sid laughed.

12
00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:57.735
He jumped and jumped and jumped.

13
00:00:57.736 --> 00:01:08.257
"You're a great jumper!" Sara said. Sid

14
00:01:08.258 --> 00:01:11.294
stopped. "Your

15
00:01:11.295 --> 00:01:14.838
turn, Rex," he said. "Who

16
00:01:14.839 --> 00:01:22.589
will swing the vine?" Rex asked. Sid

17
00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.936
smiled. "I will. Tie

18
00:01:27.937 --> 00:01:32.328
the vine to my tail!" Rex

19
00:01:32.329 --> 00:01:37.039
tied the vine to Sid's tail. "Start

20
00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:41.471
swinging, Sid!" Rex said. Sid

21
00:01:41.472 --> 00:01:45.734
swung his tail. The

22
00:01:45.735 --> 00:01:49.907
vine swung high. The

23
00:01:49.908 --> 00:01:57.365
vine swung fast. Then—

24
00:01:57.366 --> 00:02:00.268
crack!

25
00:02:00.269 --> 00:02:02.959
The tree fell over!

